apanese art of shaping behavior through design\n\n著者・編者\n    \n\nNaohiro Matsumura\n\nタイトル標目\n    \n\nShikakegaku. English\n\n著者標目\n    \n\n松村, 真宏 マツムラ, ナオヒロ ( 01160204 )典拠\n\n出版事項\n    \n\nNew York, NY : Liveright Publishing Corporation (出版)\n\n出版年月日等\n    \n\n[2021]\n\n出版年（W3CDTF）\n    \n\n2021\n\n数量\n    \n\n168 pages\n\n\nその他のタイトル\n    \n\n仕掛学 = SHIKAKEOLOGY : 人を動かすアイデアのつくり方\n\n出版地（国名コード）\n    \n\nUS\n\n本文の言語コード\n    \n\neng\n\n原文の言語コード\n    \n\njpn\n\n言語注記\n    \n\nIn English translated from the Japanese\n\nコレクション（個別）\n    \n\n日本関係外国語図書\n\n所蔵機関\n    \n\n国立国会図書館\n\n請求記号\n    \n\nM371-D1\n\n連携機関・データベース\n    \n\n国立国会図書館 : 国立国会図書館蔵書\n\nhttps://ndlsearch.ndl.go.jp\n\n書誌ID（NDLBibID）\n    \n\n030711691\n\nhttp://id.ndl.go.jp/bib/030711691\n\n\nLanguage：English\n\n  * 資料にアクセスするための手段\n    * インターネットで資料を読む\n    * 資料のコピーを入手する\n    * 図書館で資料を読む\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n‎Shikake by Naohiro Matsumura on Apple Books (https://books.apple.com/us/book/shikake/id1529749405)\nciteturn365search2 [wordlim: 200] Published: 6.0 years ago; Crawled: 4 months ago; \n\n# Shikake\n\n## The Japanese Art of Shaping Behavior Through Design\n\nNaohiro Matsumura\n\n  *     * 5.0 • 1 Rating\n\n  *     * $14.99\n\nAlso available in the Audiobook Store\n\n  *     * $14.99\n\nAlso available in the Audiobook Store\n\n## Publisher Description\n\nThe Life-Changing Magic of Tidying Up meets Nudge in this irresistible design method from Japan.\nWe are living in a time when behavioral change is necessary for our health and survival. Yet we find it exceedingly difficult to transform our own habits, let alone those of other people. Enter Naohiro Matsumura, whose powerful new design method is as astonishingly simple in its logic as it is sophisticated in its psychology. It allows any of us—from UX designers and marketers to concerned citizens and overworked parents—to address challenges in our homes, our public spaces, and our social interactions.\nAs Matsumura shows, a shikake—or “device” in Japanese—is a design that exerts influence on us through subtle nudging, rather than direct command; it encourages a particular behavior without telling its (often unwitting) user the primary purpose of that behavior. For example:\n• Footprints in a store guide shoppers and keep them socially distant\n• A basketball hoop placed over a trash can entices children to tidy up their rooms\n• A symbol of a shrine in a public square encourages respectfulness\n• A staircase painted to look like piano keys prompts exercise through play\nCombining traditional Japanese aesthetics with the lessons of behavioral economics, Matsumura reveals how to identify the hidden design cues that already shape our world, and how shikakes can help us confront some of the most pressing challenges of our era, from pandemics to declining civic engagement to climate change and beyond. Mind-bending yet elegant, Shikake presents a tool kit for anyone who wants to create their own mindful designs, for the delight and betterment of us all.\n\nGENRE\n\nImage\n\nBusiness & Personal Finance\n\nRELEASED\n\n2020\n\nNovember 3\n\nLANGUAGE\n\nEN\n\nEnglish\n\nLENGTH\n\n192\n\nPages\n\nPUBLISHER\n\nLiveright\n\nSELLER\n\nW.W. Norton & Company, Inc.\n\nSIZE\n\n29.9\n\nMB--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSHIKAKE LAB | 大阪大学 松村研究室 (https://mtmr.jp/)\nciteturn365search3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; \n\n大阪大学シカケラボが提唱する「仕掛学」。\n人の行動をポジティブに変容させ、よりよい社会を実装します。\n\n松村 真宏なおひろ\n\n教授 / 博士（工学）\n\n[Button: 経歴] [Button: 主な業績] [Button: 座右の銘]\n\n大阪大学大学院経済学研究科教授。1975年大阪府東大阪市生まれ瓢箪山育ち。1998年大阪大学基礎工学部卒業。2003年東京大学大学院工学系研究科博士課程修了。博士（工学）。2004年イリノイ大学アーバナ・シャンペーン校客員研究員、2012年〜2013年スタンフォード大学客員研究員。人工知能の研究室で博士号を取得した後、紆余曲折の末「仕掛学」を創始し、現在は仕掛学の研究・実装・普及に従事している。\n\n  * 著書：『仕掛学』（東洋経済新報社、2016）、『実践仕掛学』（東洋経済新報社、2023）、『なぜ人は穴があると覗いてしまうのか』（幻冬舎、2025）、『Shikake: The Japanese Art of Shaping Behavior Through Design』（Liveright Pub Corp、2020）など\n  * 論文：Shikakeology: designing triggers for behavior change (AI & Soc 30,2015)、The dynamism of 2channel (AI & Soc 19, 2005)、PAI: Automatic indexing for extracting asserted keywords from a document (NGCO 21, 2003)など\n  * 受賞：ベストペーパー賞（日本マーケティング学会、2017）、大阪大学賞（大阪大学、2017）、第6回World OMOSIROI Award（2020）、感謝状（愛知県常滑警察署長、2022年）、高進度賞（公文教育研究会、昭和59年）など\n\n## 📢 ニュース\n\n  * 2026.06.02 『人はなぜ穴があると覗いてしまうのか』（幻冬舎）の繁体字版『人為什麼見洞必窺? 讓人改變行為的機關學』が出版されました。\n\n## 📅 イベント\n\nUpcoming\n\n2026.10.18 医療安全実践教育研究会で発表\n\n2027.2.13 第17回仕掛学研究会\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCiNii Books - Shikake : the Japanese art of shaping behavior through design (https://ci.nii.ac.jp/ncid/BC01933401?l=en)\nciteturn365search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; \n\n# Shikake : the Japanese art of shaping behavior through design\n\n## Author(s)\n\n  *     * 松村, 真宏 マツムラ, ナオヒロ\n\n## Bibliographic Information\n\nShikake : the Japanese art of shaping behavior through design\n\nNaohiro Matsumura\n\nLiveright Publishing Corporation, c2021\n\n  * : hardcover\n\nOther Title\n    \n\nShikakegaku\n\n仕掛学\n\n## Available at  / 4 libraries\n\n  * International Research Center for Japanese Studies Library\n\n: hardcover NK||1520||Ma 00606113\n\nOPAC\n\n  * Shibaura Institute of Technology Toyosu Library芝図\n\n: hardcover 141.7/Ma82/学選1234907\n\nOPAC\n\n  * National Graduate Institute for Policy Studies Library (GRIPS Library)\n\n: hardcover 141.7||Ma82 01535352\n\nOPAC\n\n  * Tokyo Keizai University Library\n\n: hardcover/141.72/Ma 82s 1079011\n\nOPAC\n\n## Search this Book/Journal\n\n  * Calil\n  * WorldCat\n\n## Note\n\n\"Original Japanese edition published by Toyo Keizai Inc.\"--T.p. verso\n\nIncludes bibliographical references (p. [167]-168)\n\n  *   * ## Details\n\n  * NCID\n    BC01933401\n  * ISBN\n    \n    * 9781631497810\n  * LCCN\n    2020035784\n  * Country Code\n    us\n  * Title Language Code\n    eng\n  * Text Language Code\n    eng\n  * Original Language Code\n    jpn\n  * Place of